{% comment %}
================================================================================
  AlphonsoMango.in — GLOBAL SCHEMA v5.2.0 — CERTIFICATE-VERIFIED EDITION
  File: snippets/global-schema.liquid
 
  DEPLOY:  Edit Code → snippets/ → global-schema.liquid → Select All → Paste → Save
  RUNS VIA: {% render 'global-schema' %} in theme.liquid (already there — do NOT add again)
 
  CHANGES v5.2.0 (03-Sep-2026):
  ✅ All Liquid variables renamed _name → am_name to satisfy Theme Check's
     VariableName rule — clears the editor's warning count. Zero functional change.
 
  CHANGES v5.1.0 (03-Sep-2026):
  ✅ NEW: Dedicated enriched block for alphonso-mango-pulp — Aamras alternate names,
         GI fruit-source properties, year-round availability, 3-question FAQ.
  ✅ NEW: Dedicated enriched block for ALL cashew products (matched dynamically by
         product type/handle containing cashew or kaju) — Kaju alternate names,
         W180/W240/W320/W450 grade auto-detection from the title, cashew entity
         link, grade/storage/delivery FAQ. Covers every current and future cashew
         product automatically. No prices are invented — all offer data stays live.
  NOTE: Do NOT run the tool's `productschema` button — it writes a second Product
        graph to metafields (with outdated Proveda entity data); this file is now
        the single owner of product schema.
 
  CHANGES v5.0.0 (entity + credential corrections, 03-Sep-2026):
  ✅ GI FIX: AU/11054/GI/139/1264 → AU/5974/GI/139/260 EVERYWHERE (~20 occurrences)
             Verified against GI Registry Certificate No. 4163 dated 16.10.2019,
             registered to M/s. Powle Home Foods (Prashant Devendra Powle).
             AU/11054/GI/139/1264 belongs to Proveda Superfoods Pvt Ltd — a separate
             legal entity with FSSAI/GSTIN still pending — and must NOT be claimed here.
  ✅ ENTITY FIX: legalName → "Powle Home Foods" (holds FSSAI 10020022011783, GSTIN,
             APEDA 225579, GI AU/5974/GI/139/260). All "Proveda Superfoods" strings removed.
  ✅ ADDRESS FIX: "3, Bhave House" → "No. 07, Bhave House, Kale Marg, Bail Bajar,
             Kurla West" per the GI certificate — all occurrences.
  ✅ ERROR FIX: geo removed from Organization (only valid on Place/LocalBusiness types).
  ✅ ERROR FIX: speakable removed from homepage LocalBusiness (only valid on Article/WebPage).
  ✅ ERROR FIX: WebSite potentialAction/SearchAction removed — "query-input" is not a
             schema.org property, and Google retired the sitelinks search box (2024).
  ✅ ENTITY MERGE: #powle-home-foods duplicate Organization node removed (it split the
             brand entity two ways now that #organization IS Powle Home Foods).
             Product manufacturer refs repointed to #organization.
  ✅ hasCertification added to #organization (FSSAI + APEDA + GI AU/5974 w/ validFrom).
  ✅ APEDA identifier: text → registration number 225579.
  ✅ sameAs: full verified set (Instagram, Facebook, YouTube, X, Pinterest, LinkedIn,
             Google Maps). Wikipedia link removed (that page is about the fruit, not
             this organization — sameAs must point at the same entity).
  ✅ HONESTY FIX: hardcoded aggregateRating 4.7/1200 removed from homepage LocalBusiness
             and 4.8/156 from Recipe — ratings not backed by on-page reviews violate
             Google guidelines. JudgeMe metafield ratings (real) remain on products.
  ✅ FoodEstablishment type + servesCuisine removed from LocalBusiness nodes — this is
             an online produce store, not a restaurant; wrong type risks manual action.
  ✅ Devgad AU/6932 issuedBy corrected: Devgad Amba Utpadak Sangha (growers' body),
             not the GI Registry. (Verify the exact Sangha name against that certificate.)
  ✅ hasOfferCatalog numberOfItems removed (stale count).
  NOTE: The seo-schema snippet is now METAFIELD-ONLY (v8) — this file is the single
        owner of Organization/WebSite/Person/LocalBusiness entities sitewide.
 
  All v4.x structural fixes (FIX 1–32) preserved unchanged.
 
  ⚠️  SHOPIFY ADMIN ACTIONS still required (unchanged from v4.x):
  • JudgeMe JSON-LD must remain OFF (app ON, metafields ON)
  • structured-data-product.liquid must remain empty
  • entity-clustering / alphonso-ucp-patch renders must stay removed from theme.liquid
================================================================================
{% endcomment %}
 
